{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Roguelike Bullet Hell Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge relentless waves of enemy fire, upgrade your abilities and unleash devastating attacks in fast-paced, high-intensity battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/GIF_1_update.gif?t=1742903819\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Adopt Kitties to Activate Synergies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rescue abandoned Kitties and train them to assist the Invaders, boosting power and unlocking special perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/GIF_4.gif?t=1742903819\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Create Unique Meows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick from multiple <strong>Parasites and Cats</strong> to fuse into a one-of-a-kind warrior, each with its own skills and mutations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/GIF_7.gif?t=1742903819\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Evolve Through Parasite Mutations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strengthen your Meows with game-changing abilities, unlocking devastating attacks and unpredictable evolutions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/GIF_5.gif?t=1742903819\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3351710/extras/GIF_6.gif?t=1742903819\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on cockroaches, mice, dogs, elite military forces, tanks, jets, and even <strong>humanity\u2019s last hope: nuclear strikes!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph